      "text": "6. Backend Architecture",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "6. Backend Architecture",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 19,
      "index": "aI",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "text_aa28ec7c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 840.4596186493118,
      "y": 621.783320116734,
      "width": 422.4234295702496,
      "height": 595.2117950463917,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#172033",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1,
      "version": 218,
      "versionNonce": 516263722,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785922983962,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 15.360304388293974,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "API Gateway + AuthZ\n  Tenant, document and role checks\n\nCollaboration Gateway\n  WebSocket termination, session routing, backpressure\n\nDocument Session Service\n  Per-document logical leader / shard\n  Validate, order, transform/merge, commit operations\n  Broadcast committed ops\n\nOperation Log\n  Append-only durable stream / partition by documentId\n\nSnapshot Service\n  Periodic compaction of op log into snapshots\n\nMetadata DB\n  Documents, permissions, versions, comments\n\nObject Storage + CDN\n  Images, fonts, exports, snapshots\n\nPresence Service\n  Ephemeral Redis-like state with TTL\n\nVersion / Restore Service\n  Immutable checkpoints and branch/restore semantics\n\nObservability\n  per-doc lag, fanout latency, rejected ops, hot shards",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "API Gateway + AuthZ\n  Tenant, document and role checks\n\nCollaboration Gateway\n  WebSocket termination, session routing, backpressure\n\nDocument Session Service\n  Per-document logical leader / shard\n  Validate, order, transform/merge, commit operations\n  Broadcast committed ops\n\nOperation Log\n  Append-only durable stream / partition by documentId\n\nSnapshot Service\n  Periodic compaction of op log into snapshots\n\nMetadata DB\n  Documents, permissions, versions, comments\n\nObject Storage + CDN\n  Images, fonts, exports, snapshots\n\nPresence Service\n  Ephemeral Redis-like state with TTL\n\nVersion / Restore Service\n  Immutable checkpoints and branch/restore semantics\n\nObservability\n  per-doc lag, fanout latency, rejected ops, hot shards",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12,
      "index": "aJ",
      "autoResize": true
    },
