      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "7. End-to-End Flow",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "7. End-to-End Flow",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 19,
      "index": "aL",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "text_89f74361",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1421.6507150404536,
      "y": 718.6903586661787,
      "width": 447.8397521972656,
      "height": 460,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#172033",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1,
      "version": 214,
      "versionNonce": 1288810038,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785923044791,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "OPEN\n1. Route prefetch loads shell + metadata\n2. Fetch nearest snapshot and op tail in parallel\n3. Decode snapshot in worker\n4. Build normalized scene + spatial index\n5. Render visible viewport first; background-load assets\n6. Join WebSocket with last applied version\n7. Apply missing committed ops\n\nEDIT\n1. Pointer event enters interaction state machine\n2. Update transient transform at 60 FPS locally\n3. On semantic boundary, emit compact operation\n4. Apply optimistically and push to IndexedDB queue\n5. WS sends batch; backend validates and orders\n6. Ack maps local optimistic op to committed version\n7. Remote clients apply op and invalidate dirty tiles\n\nRECONNECT\n1. Resume with last committed version + pending op IDs\n2. Server sends tail or requests snapshot rebase\n3. Client reapplies unacked local operations\n4. Conflicts resolved by CRDT/OT rules or domain policy",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "OPEN\n1. Route prefetch loads shell + metadata\n2. Fetch nearest snapshot and op tail in parallel\n3. Decode snapshot in worker\n4. Build normalized scene + spatial index\n5. Render visible viewport first; background-load assets\n6. Join WebSocket with last applied version\n7. Apply missing committed ops\n\nEDIT\n1. Pointer event enters interaction state machine\n2. Update transient transform at 60 FPS locally\n3. On semantic boundary, emit compact operation\n4. Apply optimistically and push to IndexedDB queue\n5. WS sends batch; backend validates and orders\n6. Ack maps local optimistic op to committed version\n7. Remote clients apply op and invalidate dirty tiles\n\nRECONNECT\n1. Resume with last committed version + pending op IDs\n2. Server sends tail or requests snapshot rebase\n3. Client reapplies unacked local operations\n4. Conflicts resolved by CRDT/OT rules or domain policy",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12,
      "index": "aM",
      "autoResize": true
    },
