      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "8. Rendering 100k Objects",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "8. Rendering 100k Objects",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 19,
      "index": "aO",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "text_5e4c83d3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 58,
      "y": 1486,
      "width": 417.61578369140625,
      "height": 460,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#172033",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 204075690,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785923311710,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Recommended hybrid renderer\n• WebGL for scene primitives and batching\n• Canvas 2D for fallback, bitmap/text helpers\n• DOM/SVG only for active controls and accessibility\n\nTechniques\n• Scene graph separated from React tree\n• GPU instancing for repeated shapes\n• Texture atlases for icons/images/glyphs\n• Batch by shader/material/blend mode\n• Frustum/viewport culling via spatial index\n• Level of detail: bounds → simplified → full\n• Dirty rectangles / render-on-demand\n• OffscreenCanvas + worker where supported\n• Cache static layers to textures\n• Avoid per-node React components\n\nBudget\n• Frame: 16.7 ms\n• Input + JS: 3–5 ms\n• Layout/style: near zero for scene\n• GPU submit: bounded draw calls\n• Memory: release textures and object pools",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Recommended hybrid renderer\n• WebGL for scene primitives and batching\n• Canvas 2D for fallback, bitmap/text helpers\n• DOM/SVG only for active controls and accessibility\n\nTechniques\n• Scene graph separated from React tree\n• GPU instancing for repeated shapes\n• Texture atlases for icons/images/glyphs\n• Batch by shader/material/blend mode\n• Frustum/viewport culling via spatial index\n• Level of detail: bounds → simplified → full\n• Dirty rectangles / render-on-demand\n• OffscreenCanvas + worker where supported\n• Cache static layers to textures\n• Avoid per-node React components\n\nBudget\n• Frame: 16.7 ms\n• Input + JS: 3–5 ms\n• Layout/style: near zero for scene\n• GPU submit: bounded draw calls\n• Memory: release textures and object pools",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12,
      "index": "aP",
      "autoResize": true
    },
