      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785922638434,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Code splitting\n• App shell, editor core, export, comments, version history\n• Split heavy toolchains and format parsers\n• Avoid thousands of tiny chunks\n\nLazy loading\n• Load image/font assets by viewport priority\n• Defer comments/history/plugins until requested\n• Progressive snapshot chunks if format supports it\n\nRoute prefetching\n• Prefetch on intent: hover/focus or likely next route\n• Metadata first; heavy editor bundle only with confidence\n• Cancel or deprioritize on poor network\n\nHydration\n• SSR document shell, not 100k scene objects\n• Hydrate controls first; mount renderer client-side\n• Stream metadata/sidebar skeletons\n• Avoid double-fetch with route data handoff\n\nMemory leaks\n• Dispose WebGL buffers/textures\n• Unsubscribe WS and observers\n• Cancel workers/timers/RAF\n• Bound undo history and caches\n• Use heap snapshots and detached-node tracking",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Code splitting\n• App shell, editor core, export, comments, version history\n• Split heavy toolchains and format parsers\n• Avoid thousands of tiny chunks\n\nLazy loading\n• Load image/font assets by viewport priority\n• Defer comments/history/plugins until requested\n• Progressive snapshot chunks if format supports it\n\nRoute prefetching\n• Prefetch on intent: hover/focus or likely next route\n• Metadata first; heavy editor bundle only with confidence\n• Cancel or deprioritize on poor network\n\nHydration\n• SSR document shell, not 100k scene objects\n• Hydrate controls first; mount renderer client-side\n• Stream metadata/sidebar skeletons\n• Avoid double-fetch with route data handoff\n\nMemory leaks\n• Dispose WebGL buffers/textures\n• Unsubscribe WS and observers\n• Cancel workers/timers/RAF\n• Bound undo history and caches\n• Use heap snapshots and detached-node tracking",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12,
      "index": "aY",
      "autoResize": true
    },
