      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "13. Multiplayer Collaboration",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "13. Multiplayer Collaboration",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 19,
      "index": "ad",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "text_266119ae",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 949.4667038944767,
      "y": 2303.9706157864143,
      "width": 1084,
      "height": 712,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#172033",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1,
      "version": 175,
      "versionNonce": 965182454,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785923094632,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Presence\n• Ephemeral, lossy, TTL-based\n• Cursor/selection updates sampled at 10–20 Hz\n• Separate channel from durable document operations\n\nDurable edit model\nOption A: CRDT\n• Strong offline and concurrent editing\n• More metadata and implementation complexity\n\nOption B: OT / server transformation\n• Central order simplifies canonical state\n• Requires robust transform functions\n\nOption C: Domain-specific operations + revisions\n• moveNode, setProperty, insertChild, deleteNode\n• Last-writer-wins for scalar style fields\n• Fractional ordering / sequence CRDT for layers\n• Text uses dedicated text CRDT\n\nRecommended\nHybrid domain operations:\n• server assigns canonical document version\n• per-field merge policy\n• sequence CRDT for child order\n• text CRDT for live text editing\n• optimistic UI with reconciliation\n\nHot document handling\n• Sticky routing to document leader\n• Partition by documentId\n• Fanout tree/pub-sub for very large sessions\n• Backpressure and presence sampling",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Presence\n• Ephemeral, lossy, TTL-based\n• Cursor/selection updates sampled at 10–20 Hz\n• Separate channel from durable document operations\n\nDurable edit model\nOption A: CRDT\n• Strong offline and concurrent editing\n• More metadata and implementation complexity\n\nOption B: OT / server transformation\n• Central order simplifies canonical state\n• Requires robust transform functions\n\nOption C: Domain-specific operations + revisions\n• moveNode, setProperty, insertChild, deleteNode\n• Last-writer-wins for scalar style fields\n• Fractional ordering / sequence CRDT for layers\n• Text uses dedicated text CRDT\n\nRecommended\nHybrid domain operations:\n• server assigns canonical document version\n• per-field merge policy\n• sequence CRDT for child order\n• text CRDT for live text editing\n• optimistic UI with reconciliation\n\nHot document handling\n• Sticky routing to document leader\n• Partition by documentId\n• Fanout tree/pub-sub for very large sessions\n• Backpressure and presence sampling",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12,
      "index": "ae",
      "autoResize": true
    },
