      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "14. Backend Deep Dive",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "14. Backend Deep Dive",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 19,
      "index": "ag",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "text_bce75461",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2749.6385471881804,
      "y": 2286.1625249489725,
      "width": 1204,
      "height": 712,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#172033",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1,
      "version": 95,
      "versionNonce": 1452697194,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785923124255,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Ordering & idempotency\n• Unique opId and clientSeq\n• Deduplicate before commit\n• Commit version monotonically per document\n• Preserve actor order; define conflict policy across actors\n\nStorage\n• Operation log: append optimized\n• Snapshot every N ops / bytes / time\n• Metadata DB for documents and permissions\n• Blob store for snapshots and assets\n\nConsistency\n• Strong consistency for document operation order\n• Eventual consistency for presence, analytics, thumbnails\n• Read-your-writes via optimistic state + ack reconciliation\n\nScaling\n• Shard by documentId\n• Detect hot documents and isolate\n• Regional gateways; home region per document\n• Cross-region DR from replicated op log\n• Asset CDN and signed URLs\n\nReliability\n• Client retries with same opId\n• WS reconnect using lastVersion\n• Snapshot checksum and corruption fallback\n• Dead-letter invalid ops\n• Rate limit abusive clients\n• Audit permission and restore actions",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Ordering & idempotency\n• Unique opId and clientSeq\n• Deduplicate before commit\n• Commit version monotonically per document\n• Preserve actor order; define conflict policy across actors\n\nStorage\n• Operation log: append optimized\n• Snapshot every N ops / bytes / time\n• Metadata DB for documents and permissions\n• Blob store for snapshots and assets\n\nConsistency\n• Strong consistency for document operation order\n• Eventual consistency for presence, analytics, thumbnails\n• Read-your-writes via optimistic state + ack reconciliation\n\nScaling\n• Shard by documentId\n• Detect hot documents and isolate\n• Regional gateways; home region per document\n• Cross-region DR from replicated op log\n• Asset CDN and signed URLs\n\nReliability\n• Client retries with same opId\n• WS reconnect using lastVersion\n• Snapshot checksum and corruption fallback\n• Dead-letter invalid ops\n• Rate limit abusive clients\n• Audit permission and restore actions",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12,
      "index": "ah",
      "autoResize": true
    },
