      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785922638434,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "17. Staff-Level Tradeoffs & Observability",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "17. Staff-Level Tradeoffs & Observability",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 17,
      "index": "ap",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "text_3fdba57f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2378,
      "y": 3106,
      "width": 1164,
      "height": 902,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#172033",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 65850294,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785922638434,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Key tradeoffs to state clearly\n• Hybrid rendering over one-size-fits-all\n• Domain operations over raw object replacement\n• Per-document ordering over global ordering\n• Optimistic local UX plus authoritative server commit\n• Strong durability for edits; lossy presence\n• Snapshot + op log rather than rewriting whole document\n\nPerformance metrics\nFE\n• FPS, dropped frames, INP, long tasks\n• visible objects, draw calls, GPU memory\n• snapshot decode, first meaningful canvas\n• hit-test and interaction latency\n• heap growth across 30-minute sessions\n\nBE\n• join latency, commit latency, fanout latency\n• session count, ops/sec per document\n• snapshot age and compaction lag\n• reconnect success and rebase rate\n• duplicate/rejected/conflicted operations\n• hot shard saturation and queue depth\n\nTesting\n• deterministic operation replay\n• property tests for inverse/undo\n• concurrency fuzzing\n• large-scene benchmarks at 10k/100k/1M nodes\n• network partition and reconnect tests\n• browser/GPU compatibility matrix\n• accessibility keyboard and screen-reader tests\n\nInterview close\nStart with requirements, choose the rendering model,\ntrace one edit end-to-end, then deep-dive into\n100k rendering, collaboration, and undo semantics.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Key tradeoffs to state clearly\n• Hybrid rendering over one-size-fits-all\n• Domain operations over raw object replacement\n• Per-document ordering over global ordering\n• Optimistic local UX plus authoritative server commit\n• Strong durability for edits; lossy presence\n• Snapshot + op log rather than rewriting whole document\n\nPerformance metrics\nFE\n• FPS, dropped frames, INP, long tasks\n• visible objects, draw calls, GPU memory\n• snapshot decode, first meaningful canvas\n• hit-test and interaction latency\n• heap growth across 30-minute sessions\n\nBE\n• join latency, commit latency, fanout latency\n• session count, ops/sec per document\n• snapshot age and compaction lag\n• reconnect success and rebase rate\n• duplicate/rejected/conflicted operations\n• hot shard saturation and queue depth\n\nTesting\n• deterministic operation replay\n• property tests for inverse/undo\n• concurrency fuzzing\n• large-scene benchmarks at 10k/100k/1M nodes\n• network partition and reconnect tests\n• browser/GPU compatibility matrix\n• accessibility keyboard and screen-reader tests\n\nInterview close\nStart with requirements, choose the rendering model,\ntrace one edit end-to-end, then deep-dive into\n100k rendering, collaboration, and undo semantics.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12,
      "index": "aq",
      "autoResize": true
    },
